<title>USA: Beneficial files $3 bln shelf for debt.</title>
<headline>Beneficial files $3 bln shelf for debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beneficial Corp filed Tuesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $3 billion in debt securities.</p>
<p>The Wilmington, Del., holding company for consumer finance and credit-related insurance businesses said proceeds from the sale will be added to the company's general funds and used to reduce short-term debt.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
